{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cBuddy comedy\u201d visual novel with approx. 3 to 5 hours of story\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush artwork, generous event scenes, and 2D anime-style sprites\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star-studded cast of professional VA talent\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cYour mom\u2019s really pretty, y\u2019know?\u201d\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Makoto\u2019s used to hearing this from customers, neighbors, classmates, and even his best friend, Hiroki. After all, raised by single moms, these two young bachelors grew up practically in each other\u2019s homes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One innocent enough afternoon, what started as lighthearted ribbing turns into something more awkward when Hiroki confesses he has a crush on Makoto\u2019s mom. At first, Makoto laughs it off, but Hiroki quickly flips the question on him.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cCome on, don\u2019t tell me you\u2019ve never thought about my mom that way!\u201d\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Makoto freezes, speechless. The truth is he has\u2014for the longest time!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal buddy comedy about two single best friends, their crush-worthy moms, and the embarrassingly inconvenient feelings that sometimes surface when we least expect them...\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743810/extras/ea680bf5cc3a699d4af6ee7fcca37097.avif?t=1757552414\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ryoko Kudo\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mei Misonoo\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Makoto\u2019s mom. Graceful, warm, and sharper than she lets on, Ryoko runs a popular little caf\u00e9 at the edge of the shopping district. She\u2019s known for her coffee and charm, though she may not realize the effect she has on certain people, least of all her son\u2019s best friend.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743810/extras/6b7408482b4de40baf8e583d610bc47d.avif?t=1757552414\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aiko Kusakabe\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tokio Aoi\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiroki\u2019s mom. Sunny, sweet, and a little too good at pretending not to notice, Aiko used to work for a big-name company before switching to caf\u00e9 life with Ryoko. She\u2019s been close to Makoto since he was a kid, but now he\u2019s acting weirdly distant, and she\u2019s not sure why...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743810/extras/18cdfbc3aeec7b4c562707a4dd501bcb.avif?t=1757552414\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hiroki Kusakabe\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Makoto\u2019s childhood friend and next-door neighbor. Outgoing and a bit of a flirt, Hiroki hides a more sincere side beneath his frat-bro facade. Lately, he\u2019s been more vocal about his full-blown crush on Makoto\u2019s mom\u2014and senses there\u2019s something Makoto isn\u2019t saying, too.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743810/extras/89f2f66470296018db8d5bea3ddbe3ef.avif?t=1757552414\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Makoto Kudo\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2014\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mild-mannered, thoughtful judo enthusiast. Raised by his mother, Ryoko, he\u2019s used to hearing comments about how young and beautiful she looks, even from his best friend, Hiroki. He usually brushes it off, but lately, they\u2019ve been hitting closer to home...\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2743810?t=1757552414","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743810/0b03f1e6d4cded83cbabb08f17805b7791119ab8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757552414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743810/a407549e5736536c93a0425abe7f2ed314b7e6c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757552414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743810/a407549e5736536c93a0425abe7f2ed314b7e6c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757552414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains crude humor and some mild innuendo, including character designs."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cBuddy comedy\u201d visual novel with approx. 3 to 5 hours of story\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush artwork, generous event scenes, and 2D anime-style sprites\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star-studded 